---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Compass from "../components/Compass.astro";
---
<Base title="Delete your Hona account" description="How to delete your Hona account and what happens to your data.">
  <section class="band-cream on-cream slip">
    <div class="shell slip__in" style="max-width:44rem">
      <div class="mark"><Compass state="st-none" plain={true} /></div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(1.9rem,1.4rem+2vw,2.8rem)">Delete your account</h1>

      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        You can delete your Hona account from inside the app. Open
        <strong>Administration</strong>, scroll to the bottom, and choose
        <strong>Cancel Subscription &amp; Delete Account</strong>. Deletion is
        immediate and cannot be undone.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        This removes your projects, receipts, budgets, progress photographs,
        stakeholder grants and account record. Records of draw requests a lender
        approved are retained with your identity removed, because a third party
        released funds against them — the transaction remains, nothing in it
        identifies you. This is set out in full in our
        <a href="/privacy" style="border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;text-decoration:none">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="fine" style="margin-top:2rem">
        If you can no longer sign in, write to
        <a href="mailto:support@honafinancial.com?subject=Account%20deletion%20request" style="border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;text-decoration:none">support@honafinancial.com</a>
        from the address on the account and we will delete it for you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
